{'symbol': 'PWR', 'date': '2022-03-31 06:55:00', 'title': 'QUANTA SERVICES ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'HOUSTON , MARCH 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- QUANTA SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: PWR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS OF $0.07 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON APRIL 18, 2022, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF APRIL 11, 2022.'}